---
// Isolated font diagnostic page. No layout, no shared components,
// no JavaScript. Tests whether self-hosted woff2 fonts render on
// iOS Safari independent of the homepage's quiz overlay,
// first-paint script, and personalization layer.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Font test</title>
  <style is:inline>
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Instrument Serif";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/instrument-serif-400.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Inter";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/inter-400.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Inter";
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/inter-400-italic.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Inter";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/inter-500.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Inter";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/inter-600.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Inter";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/inter-700.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Lora";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/lora-400.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Lora";
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/lora-400-italic.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Lora";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/lora-600.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono";
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url("/fonts/jetbrains-mono-400.woff2") format("woff2");
    }
    body {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    p.intro {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: #a3a3a3;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      max-width: 640px;
    }
    .block {
      margin: 16px 0;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .label {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #737373;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .sample {
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .is-400 { font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; }
    .in-400 { font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; }
    .in-400i { font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; }
    .in-500 { font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; }
    .in-600 { font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; }
    .in-700 { font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; }
    .lo-400 { font-family: "Lora", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; }
    .lo-400i { font-family: "Lora", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; }
    .lo-600 { font-family: "Lora", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; }
    .jb-400 { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-weight: 400; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Font isolation test</h1>
  <p class="intro">If each line below renders in its own typeface, self-hosted woff2 works on this domain in your browser. If everything reads in the same fallback font, the woff2 files are not loading.</p>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Instrument Serif 400</p>
    <p class="sample is-400">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Inter 400</p>
    <p class="sample in-400">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Inter 400 italic</p>
    <p class="sample in-400i">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Inter 500</p>
    <p class="sample in-500">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Inter 600</p>
    <p class="sample in-600">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Inter 700</p>
    <p class="sample in-700">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Lora 400</p>
    <p class="sample lo-400">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Lora 400 italic</p>
    <p class="sample lo-400i">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">Lora 600</p>
    <p class="sample lo-600">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="label">JetBrains Mono 400</p>
    <p class="sample jb-400">The fluorescent over my desk had a flicker on the left tube.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
